WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.475
Is the data counted, or measured?

2
00:00:03.353 --> 00:00:07.178
Times are measured. They can be any value: continuous data.

3
00:00:08.081 --> 00:00:11.881
Siblings are counted. Only whole numbers: discrete data.

4
00:00:12.809 --> 00:00:16.159
A measurement is always rounded to some precision.
